<i>Yeah, I got
that information you wanted</i>

1509
01:17:31.166 --> 01:17:32.291
<i>on the Dominguez kid.</i>

1510
01:17:32.375 --> 01:17:33.208
Talk to me.

1511
01:17:33.291 --> 01:17:35.333
Clean, as far as I can tell.

1512
01:17:35.666 --> 01:17:36.583
Decorated soldier.

1513
01:17:36.666 --> 01:17:39.017
<i>Nothing but love
from everybody in the neighborhood.</i>

1514
01:17:39.041 --> 01:17:40.041
Only thing is...

1515
01:17:40.625 --> 01:17:41.458
His family.

1516
01:17:41.541 --> 01:17:43.351
- What about them?
<i>- </i><i>A cousin.</i>

1517
01:17:43.375 --> 01:17:45.375
Runs with Las Caras' boys.

1518
01:17:45.500 --> 01:17:47.060
She washes the money, from what I hear.

1519
01:17:47.125 --> 01:17:48.351
<i>This cousin got a name?</i>

1520
01:17:48.375 --> 01:17:49.375
Sure do.

1521
01:17:49.958 --> 01:17:51.083
Bennie Rodriguez.

1522
01:17:54.666 --> 01:17:55.791
All right, my man.

1523
01:17:55.916 --> 01:17:57.267
You always come through for me.

1524
01:17:57.291 --> 01:17:58.392
<i>Goddamn right.</i>

1525
01:17:58.416 --> 01:18:00.666
<i>So I guess now that you got
this lead on Gordito's ass,</i>

1526
01:18:00.750 --> 01:18:02.875
<i>you can finally stop
fucking around with Maya's kid?</i>

1527
01:18:02.958 --> 01:18:05.184
- Yeah. Something like that.
<i>- </i><i>I'll holla.</i>

1528
01:18:05.208 --> 01:18:06.208
Wow.

1529
01:18:09.791 --> 01:18:13.166
And to think this whole time, I actually
thought that you wanted to help me.

1530
01:18:13.250 --> 01:18:15.666
- It's not like what you...
- You've been using me...

1531
01:18:16.041 --> 01:18:17.416
to solve your own case.

1532
01:18:17.916 --> 01:18:19.708
When I first came to you about Karim,

1533
01:18:19.791 --> 01:18:22.791
the first thing that crossed your mind
wasn't that it could lead to Gordito?

1534
01:18:25.166 --> 01:18:26.916
Yeah, that's exactly what I thought.

1535
01:18:27.333 --> 01:18:28.684
But now you got what you needed.

1536
01:18:28.708 --> 01:18:31.541
You can abandon me again and go ahead
and follow him now, right?

1537
01:18:31.625 --> 01:18:32.708
What am I supposed to do?

1538
01:18:32.791 --> 01:18:37.208
Hm? Dominguez is a trained soldier,
who's apparently not afraid to kill.

1539
01:18:37.291 --> 01:18:40.000
And Gordito is the most dangerous
motherfucker in the city.

1540
01:18:41.291 --> 01:18:42.666
I put you through enough, son.

1541
01:18:44.291 --> 01:18:45.559
I'm just trying to keep you safe.

1542
01:18:45.583 --> 01:18:49.708
So now for the first time in my life,
you wanna pretend to be my father?

1543
01:18:49.791 --> 01:18:51.541
I am your father.

1544
01:18:51.625 --> 01:18:55.416
No, you had a choice between being
my father and being Shaft.

1545
01:18:57.166 --> 01:18:58.375
And you chose.

1546
01:19:49.625 --> 01:19:52.101
<i>Nigga, I'm not gonna
keep dealing with this shit.</i>

1547
01:19:52.125 --> 01:19:53.375
<i>Now, I done told you,</i>

1548
01:19:53.666 --> 01:19:56.416
<i>I don't know who the fuck
or what the fuck you think this is.</i>

1549
01:20:14.583 --> 01:20:16.375
Oh, crap.

1550
01:20:18.708 --> 01:20:20.392
<i>I've gotta get him away
from all of this.</i>

1551
01:20:20.416 --> 01:20:21.250
<i>Maya, Maya.</i>

1552
01:20:21.333 --> 01:20:23.293
<i>I have to get him
away from you!</i>

1553
01:20:41.416 --> 01:20:42.601
<i>- </i><i>Who is it?</i>
<i>- </i><i>Maya.</i>

1554
01:20:42.625 --> 01:20:44.583
- It's me, John.
- John?

1555
01:20:44.958 --> 01:20:45.958
How did you...

1556
01:20:47.291 --> 01:20:49.559
- Never mind. What do you want?
- You ain't gonna let me in?

1557
01:20:49.583 --> 01:20:50.583
I can hear you.

1558
01:20:50.666 --> 01:20:52.309
Come on, girl. Open the door.
Let me see your face.

1559
01:20:52.333 --> 01:20:54.642
Nigga, no. I ain't opening the door,
and you don't need to see my face.

1560
01:20:54.666 --> 01:20:56.416
- What do you want?
- Come on, give me a...

1561
01:21:03.125 --> 01:21:04.125
Look.

1562
01:21:05.000 --> 01:21:06.541
I came back because...

1563
01:21:08.208 --> 01:21:09.666
I wanted to tell you that...

1564
01:21:15.750 --> 01:21:16.750
I'm sorry.

1565
01:21:18.375 --> 01:21:19.583
Is this nigga high?

1566
01:21:23.625 --> 01:21:25.125
I never heard you say that before.

1567
01:21:25.208 --> 01:21:27.166
Yeah, I never said it before.

1568
01:21:28.666 --> 01:21:29.666
But I mean it.

1569
01:21:30.958 --> 01:21:33.333
Sorry for putting you
in harm's way last night.

1570
01:21:34.333 --> 01:21:36.541
And I'm sorry for putting
our son in danger.

1571
01:21:37.750 --> 01:21:40.541
John, you promised me
a long time ago.

1572
01:21:40.625 --> 01:21:42.226
You said as long as
you were living this life,

1573
01:21:42.250 --> 01:21:44.375
that you would stay away from JJ.

1574
01:21:44.458 --> 01:21:45.791
We agreed.

1575
01:21:47.083 --> 01:21:49.291
Yeah, I know but he's my son, so...

1576
01:22:00.875 --> 01:22:01.958
He's my son too, Maya.

1577
01:22:03.083 --> 01:22:05.333
He came to me. He asked me for help.

1578
01:22:05.458 --> 01:22:07.166
Now that I've gotten to know him,

1579
01:22:07.333 --> 01:22:10.125
things just can't go back
to being the way they were.

1580
01:22:11.833 --> 01:22:12.833
Wait.

1581
01:22:13.333 --> 01:22:14.166
He came to you?

1582
01:22:14.250 --> 01:22:15.250
Yeah.

1583
01:22:17.666 --> 01:22:18.666
Wow...

1584
01:22:19.750 --> 01:22:23.500
I spent all these years trying
to keep him away from this mess.

1585
01:22:24.333 --> 01:22:27.083
But at the end of the day,
I guess he's still a Shaft.

1586
01:22:27.166 --> 01:22:29.000
Yeah.

1587
01:22:31.791 --> 01:22:33.791
Well...

1588
01:22:35.333 --> 01:22:37.083
If JJ's going to put himself in danger,

1589
01:22:37.166 --> 01:22:39.166
at least I know
you'll be there to protect him.

1590
01:22:39.250 --> 01:22:41.208
Yeah. I will.

1591
01:22:42.500 --> 01:22:44.208
Yeah, I know.

1592
01:22:44.750 --> 01:22:46.250
So...

1593
01:22:47.125 --> 01:22:48.125
So?

1594
01:22:50.833 --> 01:22:52.333
You gonna break a brother off?

1595
01:22:54.958 --> 01:22:57.083
You had fuck it up, didn't you?

1596
01:23:02.625 --> 01:23:04.250
Yeah, she's thinking about it.

1597
01:23:09.500 --> 01:23:10.625
We were wrong.

1598
01:23:10.875 --> 01:23:13.750
The cleric wasn't the supplier
for Las Caras. Dominguez was.

1599
01:23:13.833 --> 01:23:15.375
Bennie is Dominguez's cousin.

1600
01:23:15.666 --> 01:23:18.375
So Bennie is the one who put out
the hit on us at the restaurant.

1601
01:23:18.458 --> 01:23:20.916
Right. I mean, think about it.
It makes a perfect sense.

1602
01:23:21.041 --> 01:23:22.916
Dominguez goes overseas
with the other Brothers

1603
01:23:23.000 --> 01:23:24.000
to visit troops.

1604
01:23:24.083 --> 01:23:27.541
They bring the damaged vehicles
back to the States, filled with drugs.

1605
01:23:27.625 --> 01:23:29.625
All right, I need to get closer.
Just wait here.

1606
01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:31.791
- What the hell? No.
- No. Trust me.

1607
01:23:31.875 --> 01:23:34.235
It's not that I don't think
that you can do it. It's just...

1608
01:23:34.916 --> 01:23:35.916
I need you.

1609
01:23:36.333 --> 01:23:37.333
Watch my back.

1610
01:23:38.333 --> 01:23:39.166
Please?

1611
01:23:39.250 --> 01:23:41.791
Just text me if Dominguez moves.

1612
01:23:42.916 --> 01:23:43.916
Okay.

1613
01:23:46.541 --> 01:23:48.208
- Go! Come on, let's go.
- Oh, yeah.

1614
01:24:13.041 --> 01:24:14.226
This is all going to hell.

1615
01:24:14.250 --> 01:24:15.851
- I told you not to kill Karim.
- Relax.

1616
01:24:15.875 --> 01:24:17.915
What's your big plan now?
'Cause you always got one.

1617
01:24:17.958 --> 01:24:18.976
- Enough.
- What is it?

1618
01:24:19.000 --> 01:24:21.541
Seriously. 'Cause now they're
getting close, Bennie got popped,

1619
01:24:21.625 --> 01:24:23.185
and now they know it wasn't the cleric.

1620
01:24:23.250 --> 01:24:25.101
It's only a matter of time
before they end up here.

1621
01:24:25.125 --> 01:24:26.684
- You're being paranoid.
- Oh, now it's me.

1622
01:24:26.708 --> 01:24:28.541
We just need to continue as planned.

1623
01:24:28.625 --> 01:24:30.017
We'll get this stuff to Gordito.

1624
01:24:30.041 --> 01:24:31.601
Gordito?
No. Fuck that, man.

1625
01:24:31.625 --> 01:24:34.125
Smuggling drugs was supposed to be
temporary, okay?

1626
01:24:34.291 --> 01:24:35.375
This is all your fault.

1627
01:24:35.458 --> 01:24:36.898
You got us into it. Now, get us out.

1628
01:24:40.166 --> 01:24:42.750
No. That's some
simple bitch shit. Okay.

1629
01:24:42.916 --> 01:24:43.916
We ain't gonna be her.

1630
01:24:45.458 --> 01:24:47.708
It's funny 'cause you never seem to mind

1631
01:24:47.791 --> 01:24:49.291
after I cut you in.

1632
01:24:49.375 --> 01:24:50.875
Keith, this getting out of hand.

1633
01:24:50.958 --> 01:24:52.351
We need to turn ourselves in right now.

1634
01:24:52.375 --> 01:24:55.666
You know, you're really starting
to sound a lot like Karim.

1635
01:24:56.458 --> 01:24:57.625
And look where that got him.

1636
01:24:59.000 --> 01:25:01.934
It's gonna break Bennie's heart when I
tell her that her cousin was a snitch.

1637
01:25:01.958 --> 01:25:04.291
What the hell's that supposed
to mean, Cutty?

1638
01:25:05.750 --> 01:25:06.750
It means...

1639
01:25:07.250 --> 01:25:09.166
I'm not gonna let loose ends
mess this up.

1640
01:25:09.750 --> 01:25:10.875
That's what it means.

1641
01:25:11.583 --> 01:25:13.708
I mean did you think
that we should turn ourselves in?

1642
01:25:13.791 --> 01:25:14.791
Huh? Did you?

1643
01:25:18.041 --> 01:25:18.958
Fuck! My phone!

1644
01:25:19.041 --> 01:25:20.041
Shit!

1645
01:25:21.208 --> 01:25:23.541
It's that Shaft kid.
He saw everything.

1646
01:25:25.250 --> 01:25:26.250
Get him!

1647
01:25:39.375 --> 01:25:40.375
Come on!

1648
01:25:45.958 --> 01:25:46.958
Fuck!

1649
01:26:04.833 --> 01:26:06.000
JJ!

1650
01:26:12.041 --> 01:26:14.000
The phone. Now!

1651
01:26:14.583 --> 01:26:15.708
Not gonna ask again!

1652
01:26:17.250 --> 01:26:18.517
Don't give it to him, JJ!

1653
01:26:18.541 --> 01:26:20.333
Hey, stop.

1654
01:26:20.791 --> 01:26:22.833
Come on.
Put it on the ground.

1655
01:26:22.916 --> 01:26:24.500
Now!

1656
01:26:42.750 --> 01:26:44.458
Junior! Get in the car!

1657
01:26:44.541 --> 01:26:46.375
Oh, shit!

1658
01:26:47.041 --> 01:26:48.041
Oh!

1659
01:26:53.458 --> 01:26:54.458
JJ!

1660
01:26:55.333 --> 01:26:56.458
Sasha!

1661
01:26:58.833 --> 01:27:01.041
Let's go! Hurry!

1662
01:27:01.541 --> 01:27:02.541
I'm in. Go, go!

1663
01:27:05.833 --> 01:27:06.958
JJ!

1664
01:27:13.250 --> 01:27:15.208
Ah.

1665
01:27:22.333 --> 01:27:24.666
That motherfucker's got to die.

1666
01:27:30.666 --> 01:27:32.166
We need to go find Sasha.

1667
01:27:32.291 --> 01:27:33.750
Can't the FBI handle that?

1668
01:27:34.916 --> 01:27:37.000
You just don't think that I can do this.

1669
01:27:37.083 --> 01:27:40.041
Look, I know the only person
that you give a fuck about is Gordito.

1670
01:27:40.125 --> 01:27:41.208
But I can't lose her.

1671
01:27:41.291 --> 01:27:42.791
And I can't lose you.

1672
01:27:43.666 --> 01:27:46.583
Do you wanna know why
I want Gordito so badly?

1673
01:27:47.250 --> 01:27:50.833
That motherfucker's the reason our family
got torn apart in the first place.

1674
01:27:51.250 --> 01:27:52.291
Now, he came for me,

1675
01:27:52.375 --> 01:27:54.291
your mom was in the car.
So were you.

1676
01:27:54.375 --> 01:27:55.666
You were just a baby.

1677
01:27:56.041 --> 01:27:57.583
I can't let that shit go.

1678
01:27:58.125 --> 01:27:59.375
But you know what?

1679
01:28:00.666 --> 01:28:03.958
Fuck Gordito if it means
I lose my son again.

1680
01:28:05.833 --> 01:28:07.753
I didn't come here looking
for that motherfucker.

1681
01:28:07.833 --> 01:28:09.166
I came here looking for you.

1682
01:28:12.041 --> 01:28:13.041
Thanks.

1683
01:28:15.791 --> 01:28:16.791
I'm glad you came.

1684
01:28:18.333 --> 01:28:20.375
I'm actually a little impressed
that you found me.

1685
01:28:20.458 --> 01:28:23.708
I keep telling you I know way more
about this city than that GPS shit.

1686
01:28:25.416 --> 01:28:27.833
You know what? I think I can
track Sasha's phone.

1687
01:28:28.958 --> 01:28:30.333
I just gotta get to a computer.

1688
01:28:30.416 --> 01:28:31.958
I got you. Officer Thomas!

1689
01:28:32.041 --> 01:28:33.161
Let me holla at you.

1690
01:28:35.833 --> 01:28:36.833
What is it, Shaft?

1691
01:28:36.916 --> 01:28:39.396
You got something you wanna tell me
about this little shitstorm

1692
01:28:39.458 --> 01:28:40.976
that blew through here?

1693
01:28:41.000 --> 01:28:41.833
No.

1694
01:28:41.916 --> 01:28:44.416
But my son needs to book a flight.

1695
01:28:44.500 --> 01:28:46.041
You mind if he uses your computer?

1696
01:28:47.375 --> 01:28:48.375
Book a flight.

1697
01:28:48.833 --> 01:28:49.833
Mm-hm.

1698
01:28:54.541 --> 01:28:56.666
So Cutty was running the drugs.

1699
01:28:56.750 --> 01:28:58.208
Gordito was selling them.

1700
01:28:58.375 --> 01:28:59.833
And Bennie was laundering the money.

1701
01:28:59.916 --> 01:29:02.041
Excuse me...
I'm sorry. Do y'all

1702
01:29:02.125 --> 01:29:03.125
want some mints?

1703
01:29:03.250 --> 01:29:06.125
Charge your cell phone?
Y'all need some music...

1704
01:29:06.208 --> 01:29:07.500
No, thank you. We're good.

1705
01:29:07.583 --> 01:29:09.726
All right, if you need something,
you just let me know.

1706
01:29:09.750 --> 01:29:11.833
- I got it all right here for you, okay?
- Okay.

1707
01:29:11.916 --> 01:29:13.208
So, I figure

1708
01:29:13.291 --> 01:29:15.625
Dominguez was using Cutty as a pawn,

1709
01:29:16.000 --> 01:29:18.833
to get in the gang
with Bennie and Gordito.

1710
01:29:18.916 --> 01:29:20.125
Did you say "Gordito"?

1711
01:29:20.208 --> 01:29:21.888
Ain't that like a big burrito
or something?

1712
01:29:21.916 --> 01:29:23.083
Say what?

1713
01:29:23.166 --> 01:29:24.208
Shit is good.

1714
01:29:24.333 --> 01:29:25.791
When the other Brothers found out,

1715
01:29:25.875 --> 01:29:27.500
then Cutty tried to just cut him in,

1716
01:29:27.583 --> 01:29:28.642
but Karim wouldn't go for it.

1717
01:29:28.666 --> 01:29:30.146
Hey, speaking of the Kareems,

1718
01:29:30.208 --> 01:29:33.048
why come y'all think it is that Jabbar
don't get the credit he deserves?

1719
01:29:33.083 --> 01:29:34.791
He scored more points than Jordan,

1720
01:29:34.875 --> 01:29:36.083
- LeBron...
- Babycakes.

1721
01:29:36.166 --> 01:29:37.434
- Mm?
- In case you ain't noticed,

1722
01:29:37.458 --> 01:29:39.833
we're trying to work some shit out
back here, all right?

1723
01:29:39.916 --> 01:29:43.041
You just having a conversation
out loud, so I thought I could be in it.

1724
01:29:43.125 --> 01:29:44.000
My bad.

1725
01:29:44.125 --> 01:29:46.208
Now, that still don't explain the mosque.

1726
01:29:46.291 --> 01:29:48.051
Well, maybe when Karim
didn't take the money,

1727
01:29:48.166 --> 01:29:51.125
they tried to just make him happy
by having Bennie forward his amount

1728
01:29:51.208 --> 01:29:52.083
to the cleric.

1729
01:29:52.166 --> 01:29:54.666
Right. That way, the cleric wouldn't know
the money was dirty.

1730
01:29:54.750 --> 01:29:55.750
Yeah, but I don't think

1731
01:29:55.791 --> 01:29:57.625
that Karim could live
with knowing the truth,

1732
01:29:57.708 --> 01:29:59.268
and Cutty couldn't have any loose ends,

1733
01:29:59.333 --> 01:30:00.416
so their only option...

1734
01:30:00.958 --> 01:30:01.998
- Kill Karim.
- Kill Karim.

1735
01:30:03.041 --> 01:30:05.291
- Y'all want to kill Kareem Abdul-Jabbar?
- No!

1736
01:30:05.375 --> 01:30:08.125
But I'm about to kill you,
if you don't mind your damn business

1737
01:30:08.208 --> 01:30:09.288
and drive this fucking car.

1738
01:30:11.541 --> 01:30:12.791
If we gonna take on Las Caras,

1739
01:30:12.875 --> 01:30:14.791
we're gonna need a lot more firepower.

1740
01:30:14.875 --> 01:30:16.555
I know just the motherfucker
to hook us up.

1741
01:30:17.083 --> 01:30:20.541
Look here, sweetheart. I need to
change the address we're going to.

1742
01:30:20.791 --> 01:30:21.875
Oh, you talking to me now?

1743
01:30:21.958 --> 01:30:24.638
I don't actually need to know.
You just need to put it into the app.

1744
01:30:24.666 --> 01:30:25.833
Put it in the what?

1745
01:30:25.916 --> 01:30:27.250
Yeah, I'll take care of it.

1746
01:30:27.333 --> 01:30:29.375
How come I couldn't just tell her
where we're going?

1747
01:30:48.750 --> 01:30:49.583
No doorbell?

1748
01:30:49.666 --> 01:30:50.976
He don't believe in those.

1749
01:30:51.000 --> 01:30:53.000
- Just bang on the door on your left.
- Okay.

1750
01:30:53.083 --> 01:30:54.875
You know,
on second thought, fuck it.

1751
01:30:56.958 --> 01:30:59.166
This motherfucker never locks his door.

